// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P1469863370" "You really don't get the full Architect experience until you step back from the editor and try some of the missions others have made."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P491358781" "The key is starting small. Don't try to build something epic right off the bat. <em=no> I made that mistake myself and was in over my head before I knew it."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P548281828" "The only way to learn the ins and outs of Architect is to just dive in and explore the tools to their fullest."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P3182123669" " <em=explain> ...maybe I could have Mynx fighting Bobcat... a cat fight! That's sure to get a high rating..."
