"P4216315993" "Did you know you can customize bosses or even have custom sidekicks? How cool is that!"
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P1071949291" "The Architect automatically checks your missions for errors in real time. It's pretty advanced."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P2526190481" "There are Architect buildings in nearly every zone in the city."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P2353150563" "Be careful of what enemy groups you use, that will determine what level your players will be set to."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P1674312144" "You can save as many story arcs as you want, but you can only have three published at a time."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P4087001421" "Always make sure to test a mission before publishing it."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P194726862" "Try not to make your story too complex, your players still need to be able to follow it."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P3638234133" "You can change the pacing of your missions to mix up the difficulty."
// ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P4042594003" "Don't hate the players, you want to make sure they have fun in your missions."

